# The release image is built from GoReleaser's own context, not this one, so
# this file only matters for ad-hoc `docker build .` runs. Deny by default and
# add back what an image could plausibly need — a stray dist/ or bin/ silently
# baking a stale binary into an image is the failure worth preventing.
*

!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!examples/
